      "subject": "message",
      "stage": "rtsp_fsm",
      "description": "The header MUST include the URI of the next hop (proxy or server) and a Base64-encoded (according to Section 4 of [RFC4648] and where the padding bits are set to zero) binary structure containing a sequence of DER-encoded X.509v3 certificates [RFC5280].",
